===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|schībe}}, from {{inh|de|goh|skība}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*skībǭ}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*skey-||to cut, part, divide, separate}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|schijf}}, {{cog|en|shive}}, {{m|en|sheave}}, {{m|en|skive}}, {{cog|non|skífa}}.

